        <body>
            <div xml:id="d60">

                <pb facs="0183" n="1143" sameAs="frus:frus1888p2/pg1143"/>

                <head>No. 773.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bragg to Mr. Bayard.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1888-03-09"><hi rendition="#italic">March</hi> 9, 1888</date>.
                        (Received March 19.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 6.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Last evening I received your instruction,
                    No. 270, of 27th ultimo, addressed to Mr. Connery, and relative to the arrest of
                    Oliver Woods, at Ventanas, Durango, and I to-day wrote a note to Mr. Mariscal,
                    copy of which I inclose. My presentation of this matter I hope will meet with
                    your approval.</p>
                <p>I will promptly forward to you any information the Mexican Government may
                    furnish.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Edwd. S. Bragg.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d60-a1.xml" xpointer="d60-a1"/>
